  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Home of the Red Fox** (2 other sources): Played as a linked sequence running into Bringing In The Georgia Mail, then Little Maggie [1][3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Deep Blue Sea**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **There is Time**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Letter to Seymour**: rare: 11 archived performances [5]\n- **Dust In the Baggy**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Im In Hiding**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- **Lay Down My Old Guitar**: rare: 6 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bs2017-07-28.sbdflac24** (recommended): audience recording; 18 songs; 102 min [1]\n- **bs2017-07-28.matrix.dr40.flac24**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 17 songs; 102 min [2]\n- **bs2017-07-28.aud.at835.dr40.flac24**: audience recording; 17 songs; 98 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- This listener's list opens with These Old Blues and Pyramid County, and ends with Samson and Delilah [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bs2017-07-28.sbdflac24**: taped by Jen Fisher-/Microfishie Upstreaming; transferred by Jen Fisher-/Microfishie Upstreaming; source: AUD> AT835> TASCAM DR-40 > WAV (24/48K)> FLAC > SD [1]. Also: Soundboard feed recorded to a Tascam DR-40 at 24-bit/48k, converted to FLAC, then edited in Audacity [1]\n- **bs2017-07-28.matrix.dr40.flac24**: taped by Jen Fisher-/Microfishie Upstreaming; transferred by Jen Fisher-/Microfishie Upstreaming; source: AUD> DR40 internal mics+SBD > TASCAM DR-40 > WAV (24/48K)> FLAC > SD [2]. Also: Blend of the DR-40's internal audience mics and a soundboard feed, edited in Audacity with noise reduction and click removal [2]\n- **bs2017-07-28.aud.at835.dr40.flac24**: taped by Jen Fisher-/Microfishie Upstreaming; transferred by Jen Fisher-/Microfishie Upstreaming; source: AUD> AT835+DR40 internal mics> TASCAM DR-40 > WAV (24/48K)> FLAC > SD [3]. Also: Audience recording with an AT835 mic plus the Tascam DR-40's internal mics, 24-bit/48k, edited in Audacity [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by JamBase: [Sawtooth Valley Gathering 2017 Lineup - Jul 28 - 29, 2017](https://www.jambase.com/festival/sawtooth-valley-gathering-2017) [6]",
